{"uid":"c40518cbaa4f881a","name":"test_real_reflect_run_report_is_printable_after_the_engine_is_gone","fullName":"tests.test_cli_artifacts#test_real_reflect_run_report_is_printable_after_the_engine_is_gone","historyId":"5e1a157624ac2d314c17b46649d670b2","time":{"start":1791958083779,"stop":1791958084948,"duration":1169},"description":"The fixture is `artifacts/reflection/` as the REFLECT PHASE wrote it:\n    `ralphctl artifacts` must list and print it once the engine (the stand-in\n    for the container) is gone.\n\n    Task 015 (requirement E.1, #169) retired the off-budget grace review\n    this fixture's `iterations: 2` used to lean on: planning (1) + worker\n    (1) left no budget for the review that turns the run terminal, and\n    the retired grace review used to supply that review off-budget for\n    free once every task (there is exactly one, `STUB_TASKS: 1`) was\n    complete. Without it the run now holds `timed_out` with no review\n    ever run and no `reflect` phase to write the report this test looks\n    for -- so the budget now covers the ordinary planning+worker+review\n    path outright, same as any other real-engine fixture past this task.\n    v0.36 requirement B adds one spare iteration past the verdict: a\n    verdict on the last charged iteration holds `exhausted`.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The fixture is <code>artifacts/reflection/</code> as the REFLECT PHASE wrote it:<br />\n<code>ralphctl artifacts</code> must list and print it once the engine (the stand-in<br />\nfor the container) is gone.</p>\n<pre><code>Task 015 (requirement E.1, #169) retired the off-budget grace review\nthis fixture's `iterations: 2` used to lean on: planning (1) + worker\n(1) left no budget for the review that turns the run terminal, and\nthe retired grace review used to supply that review off-budget for\nfree once every task (there is exactly one, `STUB_TASKS: 1`) was\ncomplete. Without it the run now holds `timed_out` with no review\never run and no `reflect` phas